<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Little Claude - 大模型 Agent 桌面工作站</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            background: #0f0f14;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 700px;
            width: 100%;
            background: #1a1a24;
            border: 1px solid #2a2a3a;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 50px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6c5ce7, #a29bfe);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 36px;
            margin: 0 auto 24px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .tagline {
            color: #a29bfe;
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .description {
            color: #a0a0b8;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 36px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .feature {
            background: #22222f;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #c0c0d0;
        }
        .feature::before {
            content: "✦ ";
            color: #a29bfe;
        }
        .divider {
            border: none;
            border-top: 1px solid #2a2a3a;
            margin: 0 0 32px;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 13px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #6a6a7e;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .download-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 14px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }
        .btn-kuake {
            background: #2b2b3a;
            color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #3a3a50;
        }
        .btn-kuake:hover { background: #3a3a50; }
        .btn-baidu {
            background: #2468e0;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .btn-baidu:hover { background: #1a5ad4; }
        .btn-github {
            background: #fff;
            color: #0f0f14;
        }
        .btn-github:hover { background: #e8e8e8; }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 36px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #4a4a5e;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #6c5ce7;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        @media (max-width: 500px) {
            .container { padding: 32px 20px; }
            h1 { font-size: 24px; }
            .download-buttons { flex-direction: column; }
            .btn { justify-content: center; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- ===== 图标区 ===== -->
        <div class="icon">🖥️</div>
        <!-- ===== 项目名和标语 ===== -->
        <h1>Little Claude</h1>
        <p class="tagline">大模型 Agent 桌面工作站 — 零门槛使用最强 AI 编程助手</p>
        <!-- ===== 项目介绍 ===== -->
        <p class="description">
            Claude Code 和 Codex 是当前最强的 AI 编程工具，但仅提供命令行界面，对普通用户门槛极高。
            Little Claude 将其封装为跨平台桌面应用（Tauri 2 + React 19 + Rust），提供图形化界面与一键安装体验，
            让非技术用户也能轻松使用大模型进行编程和日常任务。<br><br>
            ✅ 支持 Anthropic / OpenAI 兼容 / DeepSeek / 智谱 / 通义千问等多模型动态切换<br>
            ✅ SDK 双向控制协议，工具调用经交互式权限卡片审批，安全可控<br>
            ✅ NDJSON 流式推理，思考链可视化，多 Tab 并行会话，支持 Rewind 回退<br>
            ✅ 集成视频分析、图像识别等多模态能力<br>
            ✅ 便携式单文件 EXE（约 22MB），无需安装即可运行
        </p>
        <!-- ===== 特性 ===== -->
        <div class="features">
            <div class="feature">多模型统一调度与成本优化</div>
            <div class="feature">Agent 工具调用安全机制</div>
            <div class="feature">流式推理 · 思考链可视化</div>
            <div class="feature">多模态：视频分析 + 图像识别</div>
            <div class="feature">多 Tab 并行 · Rewind 回退</div>
            <div class="feature">一键安装 · 便携版 22MB</div>
        </div>
        <hr class="divider">
        <!-- ===== 下载区域 ===== -->
        <p class="section-title">📥 下载渠道</p>
        <div class="download-buttons">
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-kuake" style="opacity:0.5;pointer-events:none;">
                <span>☁️</span> 夸克网盘（即将上线）
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-baidu" style="opacity:0.5;pointer-events:none;">
                <span>📦</span> 百度网盘（即将上线）
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/qingyu321/Little-Claude" class="btn btn-github" target="_blank">
                <span>⭐</span> GitHub
            </a>
        </div>
        <!-- ===== 页脚 ===== -->
        <p class="footer">
            完全免费 · 开源 · Made by 高渊博 · 去 <a href="https://github.com/qingyu321/Little-Claude" target="_blank">GitHub</a> 点个 Star ⭐
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
